# Kroha OS — парящий док снизу по центру (закреплённые программы | открытые окна)
# Размытие под доком делает picom (правило для окна kroha-dock).
#-------------------------------------
# Фон 1: стекло дока
rounded = @DOCK_RADIUS@
border_width = 1
border_sides = TBLR
border_content_tint_weight = 0
background_content_tint_weight = 0
background_color = @BG@ @GLASS_OPACITY@
border_color = #FFFFFF 10
background_color_hover = @BG@ @GLASS_OPACITY@
border_color_hover = #FFFFFF 10
background_color_pressed = @BG@ @GLASS_OPACITY@
border_color_pressed = #FFFFFF 10

# Фон 2: иконка (подсветка при наведении)
rounded = 14
border_width = 0
border_sides = TBLR
background_color = #FFFFFF 0
border_color = #FFFFFF 0
background_color_hover = #FFFFFF 12
border_color_hover = #FFFFFF 0
background_color_pressed = #FFFFFF 18
border_color_pressed = #FFFFFF 0

# Фон 3: запущенная программа (акцентная полоска снизу)
rounded = 3
border_width = 3
border_sides = B
background_color = #FFFFFF 0
border_color = @ACCENT@ 70
background_color_hover = #FFFFFF 12
border_color_hover = @ACCENT@ 100
background_color_pressed = #FFFFFF 18
border_color_pressed = @ACCENT@ 100

# Фон 4: активное окно
rounded = 3
border_width = 3
border_sides = B
background_color = #FFFFFF 12
border_color = @ACCENT@ 100
background_color_hover = #FFFFFF 16
border_color_hover = @ACCENT@ 100
background_color_pressed = #FFFFFF 20
border_color_pressed = @ACCENT@ 100

# Фон 5: подсказка
rounded = 8
border_width = 1
border_sides = TBLR
background_color = @PANEL@ 95
border_color = #FFFFFF 10
background_color_hover = @PANEL@ 95
border_color_hover = #FFFFFF 10
background_color_pressed = @PANEL@ 95
border_color_pressed = #FFFFFF 10

#-------------------------------------
panel_items = L:T
panel_size = 100% 68
panel_margin = 0 10
panel_padding = 10 8 6
panel_background_id = 1
wm_menu = 0
panel_dock = 0
panel_position = bottom center horizontal
panel_layer = top
panel_monitor = primary
panel_shrink = 1
autohide = 0
strut_policy = follow_size
panel_window_name = kroha-dock
disable_transparency = 0
mouse_effects = 1
font_shadow = 0
mouse_hover_icon_asb = 100 0 12
mouse_pressed_icon_asb = 100 0 -8
scale_relative_to_dpi = 0
scale_relative_to_screen_height = 0

#-------------------------------------
# Разделитель между закреплёнными и открытыми
separator = new
separator_background_id = 0
separator_color = #FFFFFF 14
separator_style = line
separator_size = 1
separator_padding = 6 12

#-------------------------------------
# Закреплённые программы
launcher_padding = 0 0 6
launcher_background_id = 0
launcher_icon_background_id = 2
launcher_icon_size = 42
launcher_icon_asb = 100 0 0
launcher_icon_theme_override = 0
startup_notifications = 1
launcher_tooltip = 1
launcher_item_app = /usr/share/applications/kroha-launcher.desktop
launcher_item_app = firefox-esr.desktop
launcher_item_app = pcmanfm.desktop
launcher_item_app = lxterminal.desktop
launcher_item_app = org.xfce.mousepad.desktop
launcher_item_app = mpv.desktop
launcher_item_app = synaptic.desktop

#-------------------------------------
# Открытые окна — только иконки
taskbar_mode = single_desktop
taskbar_hide_if_empty = 1
taskbar_padding = 0 0 6
taskbar_background_id = 0
taskbar_active_background_id = 0
taskbar_name = 0
taskbar_hide_inactive_tasks = 0
taskbar_hide_different_monitor = 0
taskbar_always_show_all_desktop_tasks = 0
taskbar_distribute_size = 0
taskbar_sort_order = none
task_align = center
task_text = 0
task_icon = 1
task_centered = 1
urgent_nb_of_blink = 8
task_maximum_size = 54 54
task_padding = 6 6 0
task_tooltip = 1
task_thumbnail = 0
task_icon_asb = 100 0 0
task_background_id = 3
task_active_background_id = 4
task_urgent_background_id = 4
task_iconified_background_id = 3
task_iconified_icon_asb = 70 0 0
mouse_left = toggle_iconify
mouse_middle = close
mouse_right = none
mouse_scroll_up = none
mouse_scroll_down = none

#-------------------------------------
tooltip_show_timeout = 0.3
tooltip_hide_timeout = 0.1
tooltip_padding = 8 5
tooltip_background_id = 5
tooltip_font_color = @TEXT@ 100
tooltip_font = @FONT_UI@ 9
